<title>CHINA: China Light says 3rd interim div HK$0.34.</title>
<headline>China Light says 3rd interim div HK$0.34.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Third interim div (H.K. cents)  34.0   vs  32.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				14,618 vs  12,389</p>
<p>    Company name			  China Light and Power Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			   August 15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		    September 15</p>
<p>Note - China Light and Power generates and supplies electricity in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
